  "notes": "FORMS:\n{反発|はんぱつ}する - to oppose, to resist; to repel, to rebound\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反発|はんぱつ}を{招|まね}く - to invite opposition\n- {反発|はんぱつ}{力|りょく} - repulsive force; resilience\n- {高|たか}{反発|はんぱつ} - high resilience (mattresses, golf clubs)\n- {低|てい}{反発|はんぱつ} - low resilience (memory foam)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{反感|はんかん} is a feeling of dislike, while {反発|はんぱつ} involves active opposition or resistance.",
